161
00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:19.170
Curtis Hollis : And, they are also good when problem is complex or changes over time, and agents need to, like, adapt or coordinate to handle new situations. And, I think on the other hand, I'd say the MAS is not the best choice for problems that are very simple or linear, because where one program or one AI can solve everything quickly.

162
00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:26.680
Curtis Hollis : So, if the test doesn't, like, need multiple agents to work together, I think adding MAS just makes it more complicated without much benefit.

